            "text": "theorem profile_ode_within {a z : ℝ} (ha : 1 < a) (hz : 0 ≤ z) :\n    z ^ 2 * iteratedDerivWithin 2 (profile a) (Ici 0) z +\n      (1 + 2 * a * z) * derivWithin (profile a) (Ici 0) z +\n      a * (a - 1) * profile a z = 0"
